{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SYTBranchingComplete","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTBranchingComplete","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SYTBranchingRecursion","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SYTCornerListConnection"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.numSYTenum_eq_dimHLF_of_dimHLF_branching","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.numSYTenum_eq_dimHLF_of_dimHLF_branching","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTBranchingComplete.lean#L60-L66","doc":"**The general HLF, now reduced to the single β-Lagrange identity (A).** Plugging the proved (B)\n`numSYTenum_branching` into the scaffold's composition leaves only (A) `dimHLF_branching` as a\nhypothesis — `numSYTenum = dimHLF` for every sorted shape, conditional on (A) alone. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.numSYTenum_branching","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.numSYTenum_branching","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTBranchingComplete.lean#L46-L58","doc":"**Branching obligation (B), discharged (sorry-free).** The brute-force standard-tableau count\nsatisfies the corner-removal recursion `numSYTenum m = ∑_{i corner} numSYTenum (m⁻ⁱ)` — the hard\nbijection half of `numSYTenum_eq_dimHLF_of_branchings`.  Proved by transporting `cornerRecursion_proof`\nonto the scaffold's `branchSum` vocabulary. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.numSYTenum_decrementRow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.numSYTenum_decrementRow","kind":"theorem","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTBranchingComplete.lean#L38-L44","doc":"`decrementRow` and `removeCorner` give the same standard-tableau count: they differ only by the\ntrailing `0`-length row that `removeCorner` filters, which leaves `numSYTenum` unchanged. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.removableCornerIdxs_eq_corners","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.removableCornerIdxs_eq_corners","kind":"theorem","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTBranchingComplete.lean#L27-L36","doc":"The scaffold's `removableCornerIdxs` is exactly the connection's `corners` (same predicate over the\nsame range — `IsCorner` adds only the `i < length` already guaranteed by `List.range`). ","signatureChunk":0}]}